[{"text": "The assembly will now head addressed by", "start": 0.64, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "his excellency", "start": 2.48, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "sirin top", "start": 4.24, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "prime minister of the kingdom of Bhutan.", "start": 6.799, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "I request protocol to escort his", "start": 11.36, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "excellency and invite him to address the", "start": 13.679, "duration": 5.401}, {"text": "assembly.", "start": 16.08, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 33.76, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "excellencies,", "start": 36.0, "duration": 5.719}, {"text": "ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 38.079, "duration": 3.64}, {"text": "I stand before you today", "start": 41.92, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "not as a prime minister", "start": 44.96, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "but as a salesman.", "start": 48.239, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "And I'm here not to sell you a product", "start": 51.2, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "or a policy", "start": 54.399, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "or yet another declaration.", "start": 56.559, "duration": 9.121}, {"text": "I am here to sell you an idea.", "start": 59.84, "duration": 9.12}, {"text": "An idea conceived and spearheaded by his", "start": 65.68, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "majesty king Jigmi Kasar Nami Wongchuk.", "start": 68.96, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "An idea embraced by the people of", "start": 73.52, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "Bhutan.", "start": 76.56, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "An idea already being built.", "start": 78.88, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "That idea", "start": 83.84, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "is Gaulifu Mindfulness City.", "start": 86.0, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "GMC.", "start": 90.88, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "And my sales pitch is simple.", "start": 93.6, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "Come and build it with us.", "start": 96.4, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "Now, the world has built new cities", "start": 101.6, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "before.", "start": 103.6, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "Financial centers, free ports,", "start": 105.52, "duration": 8.8}, {"text": "technology hubs, special economic zones.", "start": 108.799, "duration": 8.721}, {"text": "But GMC is different.", "start": 114.32, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "You see, Gaulifu Mindfulness City is a", "start": 117.52, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "special administrative region,", "start": 120.56, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "an SR.", "start": 123.6, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "Under its royal charter, GMC exercises", "start": 126.719, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "full autonomy in governance,", "start": 130.399, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "legislation, and the judiciary.", "start": 133.36, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "Think one country, two systems.", "start": 137.04, "duration": 8.32}, {"text": "Think of the agility of a micro state.", "start": 140.64, "duration": 8.319}, {"text": "But GMC was not inherited from history.", "start": 145.36, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "It was not created to manage a transfer", "start": 148.959, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "of sovereignity.", "start": 152.48, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "It is being deliberately created by", "start": 155.28, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "Bhutan within Bhutan on sovereign", "start": 158.08, "duration": 8.72}, {"text": "Bhutanese territory for the future.", "start": 161.36, "duration": 8.879}, {"text": "GMC covers more than 4,000 square", "start": 166.8, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "kilometers.", "start": 170.239, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "that is more than five times the size of", "start": 171.92, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "Singapore.", "start": 175.04, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "But its greatest opportunity is not its", "start": 177.2, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "size.", "start": 180.4, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "Its greatest opportunity is an", "start": 181.92, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "institutional blank slate.", "start": 184.64, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "GMC was given something extraordinarily", "start": 188.879, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "rare. The freedom to design an entire", "start": 191.599, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "city and its operating systems from", "start": 195.04, "duration": 6.559}, {"text": "first principles.", "start": 198.64, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "So we asked, \"If you could begin again,", "start": 201.599, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "how would you govern?", "start": 204.879, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "What laws would you write?", "start": 207.44, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "How would we regulate business? How", "start": 210.239, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "would we guarantee an independent", "start": 212.799, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "judiciary?", "start": 214.64, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "How would we attract the best talent?", "start": 216.159, "duration": 4.561}, {"text": "How would we use technology and", "start": 218.879, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "especially artificial intelligence?", "start": 220.72, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "How would we create wealth by protecting", "start": 223.84, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "nature?", "start": 226.239, "duration": 3.601}, {"text": "And ultimately", "start": 227.92, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "what would all that prosperity", "start": 229.84, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "be for?", "start": 232.799, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "These were not theoretical questions. We", "start": 235.2, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "answered them and we are making full use", "start": 238.159, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "of that institutional blank slate.", "start": 241.68, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "If Singapore has legal principles at", "start": 246.159, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "work, we learn from Singapore. If Abu", "start": 248.159, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "Dhabi has financial regulations at work,", "start": 251.04, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "we learn from Abu Dhabi. If leading", "start": 253.28, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "jurists from the United Kingdom can help", "start": 256.079, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "us build an independent jury judiciary,", "start": 258.88, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "we learn from them. And if international", "start": 262.24, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "experts can strengthen our institutions,", "start": 265.12, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "we learn from them.", "start": 267.919, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "The principle is simple. Search the", "start": 270.88, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "world for what works. Take the best,", "start": 274.0, "duration": 7.919}, {"text": "adapt it, and make it work for GMC.", "start": 276.72, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "The result is a core operating system", "start": 281.919, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "that is now in place designed to give", "start": 284.4, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "investors clarity, familiarity, and", "start": 287.36, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "predictability.", "start": 290.72, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "But GMC's operating system was designed", "start": 292.96, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "around a deeper conviction", "start": 296.479, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "that prosperity and values should", "start": 299.52, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "reinforce one another.", "start": 302.32, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "That means rejecting the assumption that", "start": 305.68, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "we must choose between enterprise and", "start": 308.4, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "well-being,", "start": 311.36, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "between technology and humanity,", "start": 313.199, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "between development and nature.", "start": 316.479, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "At GMC, we believe a balanced approach", "start": 320.639, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "can deliver substantial profits while", "start": 323.919, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "protecting the values that makes", "start": 326.639, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "prosperity worthwhile.", "start": 329.199, "duration": 7.681}, {"text": "Balance is not the enemy of profit. It", "start": 332.8, "duration": 8.48}, {"text": "is the foundation of lasting profit.", "start": 336.88, "duration": 8.879}, {"text": "And at GMC, balance is not a slogan. It", "start": 341.28, "duration": 8.4}, {"text": "is built into the operating system.", "start": 345.759, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "And this matters deeply to Bhutan.", "start": 349.68, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "You see, Bhutan is peaceful and stable.", "start": 353.919, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "Our forests are intact. Our culture is", "start": 357.52, "duration": 7.679}, {"text": "alive. Our people are educated", "start": 359.68, "duration": 8.959}, {"text": "but our economy is small. It cannot yet", "start": 365.199, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "create enough opportunities for our", "start": 368.639, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "young people. So too many of them leave", "start": 371.199, "duration": 8.56}, {"text": "home to find opportunity elsewhere.", "start": 374.72, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "For a country as small as ours, this is", "start": 379.759, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "not only an economic challenge. It is an", "start": 382.8, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "existential one.", "start": 386.0, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "We cannot simply tell them to stay. We", "start": 389.039, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "must give them a reason to stay and a", "start": 392.319, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "reason to return.", "start": 395.52, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "Jobs, opportunities, enterprise, a", "start": 397.6, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "future.", "start": 401.199, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "So, Bhutan must transform.", "start": 403.28, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "But we refuse to believe that", "start": 406.0, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "transformation requires us to become", "start": 408.08, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "somebody else.", "start": 410.479, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "We want economic growth. We want", "start": 412.72, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "investment. We want technology. We want", "start": 415.039, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "successful companies. We want our people", "start": 418.0, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "to become wealthier.", "start": 421.28, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "But we also want to protect what makes", "start": 423.759, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "Bhutan", "start": 426.88, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "Bhutan.", "start": 428.56, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "That is the driving force behind his", "start": 431.039, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "majesty's vision for GMC", "start": 433.759, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "and that is why his majesty is", "start": 437.12, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "personally spearheading its development.", "start": 439.12, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "GMC is not a project on the margins of", "start": 443.599, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "Bhutan. It is at the heart of our", "start": 446.8, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "national transformation.", "start": 450.56, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Our people have embraced GMC as a", "start": 453.44, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "people's project, an investment in our", "start": 455.68, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "children, our economy, and our shared", "start": 458.56, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "future.", "start": 461.599, "duration": 4.241}, {"text": "Bhutan is not waiting to see whether the", "start": 463.68, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "world believes in GMC", "start": 465.84, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "before committing to it. We have", "start": 468.479, "duration": 6.881}, {"text": "committed fully.", "start": 471.199, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "Now let me tell you why GMC is built to", "start": 475.36, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "succeed.", "start": 478.24, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "Begin with location.", "start": 480.24, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "GMC sits directly on the border with", "start": 482.56, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "India. Our closest friend and neighbor.", "start": 485.68, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "The vision enjoys the support of Prime", "start": 490.16, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "Minister Narendra Modi, the government", "start": 492.24, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "of India and our neighbors across the", "start": 494.479, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "border in Assam. Beyond that border lies", "start": 497.199, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "the world's most populous country and", "start": 500.8, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "one of its largest and fastest growing", "start": 503.84, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "economies.", "start": 506.72, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "GMC is also a gateway to the markets of", "start": 509.12, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "South Asia and Southeast Asia.", "start": 511.84, "duration": 8.48}, {"text": "So GMC begins with what many new cities", "start": 515.919, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "spend decades trying to acquire.", "start": 520.32, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "Access to vast and growing markets,", "start": 523.839, "duration": 6.881}, {"text": "connectivity and in India a trusted", "start": 527.12, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "friend.", "start": 530.72, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "Bhutan brings another advantage, one", "start": 533.2, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "that cannot be bought.", "start": 536.16, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "Trust.", "start": 539.36, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "trust built through peace, political", "start": 541.36, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "stability, the rule of law, and a record", "start": 543.92, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "for honoring our commitments.", "start": 547.279, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "For long-term investors, trust creates", "start": 550.8, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "something invaluable,", "start": 553.92, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "predictability.", "start": 557.12, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "Bhutan has spent generations building", "start": 559.519, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "that trust.", "start": 561.6, "duration": 3.359}, {"text": "GMC", "start": 563.44, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "puts it to work.", "start": 564.959, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "Then there is nature. Imagine GMC in the", "start": 567.76, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "morning,", "start": 571.519, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "mist rising from its rivers,", "start": 573.04, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "forest stretching towards the mountains,", "start": 576.399, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "elephants moving through the landscape,", "start": 579.2, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "tigers still roaming its forest. This is", "start": 582.0, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "not empty land. It is a living carbon", "start": 585.519, "duration": 8.641}, {"text": "negative landscape, a biodiversity", "start": 589.92, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "hotspot.", "start": 594.16, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "We will not build over it. We will build", "start": 596.64, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "within it and protect it.", "start": 599.519, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "The forests, rivers and wildlife of GMC", "start": 603.279, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "are not obstacles to development. They", "start": 606.32, "duration": 7.24}, {"text": "are part of its value.", "start": 609.44, "duration": 4.12}, {"text": "And then there's energy.", "start": 613.6, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "Bhutan is expanding its renewable energy", "start": 615.76, "duration": 9.04}, {"text": "capacity towards 25 gaw by 2040.", "start": 618.399, "duration": 10.401}, {"text": "That electricity will power GMC and the", "start": 624.8, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "industries of the future. Advanced", "start": 628.8, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "manufacturing, scientific research,", "start": 631.44, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "artificial intelligence and data", "start": 634.079, "duration": 8.041}, {"text": "centers. Clean renewable power.", "start": 636.16, "duration": 5.96}, {"text": "But GMC has another type of power.", "start": 642.24, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "A power Bhutan has cultivated for", "start": 645.68, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "centuries.", "start": 648.0, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "Spiritual power.", "start": 650.72, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "GMC is being developed as a global", "start": 653.6, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "center for Bajayana Buddhism.", "start": 656.48, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "Spiritual masters from across the", "start": 659.92, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "Buddhist world are already building", "start": 662.24, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "monasteries, retreat centers, libraries", "start": 664.48, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "and institutions of learning.", "start": 668.16, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "So imagine what will exist side by side.", "start": 671.519, "duration": 7.121}, {"text": "entrepreneurs and monks,", "start": 675.76, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "artificial intelligence and human", "start": 678.64, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "consciousness,", "start": 680.8, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "data centers and meditation centers, the", "start": 682.48, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "newest technology human humanity has", "start": 686.56, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "created alongside some of the world's", "start": 689.44, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "oldest traditions for understanding the", "start": 692.32, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "human mind.", "start": 695.76, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "Is that a contradiction?", "start": 698.56, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "No.", "start": 701.36, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "In fact, that is the point.", "start": 702.959, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "GMC is not asking investors to choose", "start": 707.04, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "between commercial success and quality", "start": 709.92, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "of life. It is designed for both.", "start": 713.76, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "Because the world's best people choose", "start": 717.44, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "more than a workplace. They choose where", "start": 720.32, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "to build their lives.", "start": 723.76, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "Taken together, these advantages create", "start": 726.639, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "the conditions for businesses to grow", "start": 730.32, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "and investors to prosper.", "start": 733.279, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "Lower uncertainty,", "start": 736.88, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "abundant clean energy, access to growth,", "start": 739.12, "duration": 8.719}, {"text": "the ability to attract global talent and", "start": 743.68, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "the freedom to create the markets other", "start": 747.839, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "others will later enter.", "start": 750.399, "duration": 7.601}, {"text": "That is how GMC turns its values into", "start": 753.68, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "commercial advantage.", "start": 758.0, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "Now you may reasonably ask.", "start": 760.32, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "It sounds wonderful.", "start": 763.279, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "But is it real?", "start": 765.76, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "Yes,", "start": 768.24, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "it is real.", "start": 769.76, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "The Royal Charter is in force.", "start": 772.32, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "Laws have been enacted.", "start": 775.2, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "Regulators are operating. The framework", "start": 777.68, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "for an independent judiciary is in", "start": 779.76, "duration": 3.759}, {"text": "place.", "start": 782.079, "duration": 3.681}, {"text": "GMC has its own government, its own", "start": 783.519, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "laws, its own financial systems and its", "start": 785.76, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "own goldback digital currency.", "start": 788.72, "duration": 7.679}, {"text": "These are not aspirations. They are", "start": 793.44, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "foundations already in place.", "start": 796.399, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "The physical city is also taking sh is", "start": 800.0, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "also taking shape. Infrastructure is", "start": 803.12, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "being built progressively as and when it", "start": 805.92, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "is needed.", "start": 809.04, "duration": 3.2}, {"text": "The international airport is under", "start": 810.56, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "construction.", "start": 812.24, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "A railway connection to India's vast", "start": 813.92, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "rail network is being developed. Energy,", "start": 816.32, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "digital connectivity and urban", "start": 820.16, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "infrastructure are being added as demand", "start": 822.0, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "grows.", "start": 825.2, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "Artificial intelligence and data center", "start": 826.88, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "projects are moving forward and nearly 5", "start": 829.04, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "billion US dollars in projects are under", "start": 832.56, "duration": 6.76}, {"text": "active negotiation.", "start": 835.6, "duration": 3.72}, {"text": "GMC is not an idea waiting to begin.", "start": 839.519, "duration": 8.801}, {"text": "The journey has begun,", "start": 844.8, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "but there is still an extraordinary", "start": 848.32, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "opportunity to help define where it", "start": 850.48, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "goes.", "start": 853.92, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "And perhaps the best way to understand", "start": 855.6, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "GMC is to imagine it as a startup, a", "start": 857.68, "duration": 9.12}, {"text": "4,000 square kilometer startup.", "start": 862.399, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "Now, most startups begin with an idea,", "start": 866.8, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "then search for the conditions they need", "start": 869.68, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "to succeed.", "start": 872.24, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "GMC begins with many of them already in", "start": 874.16, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "place. His Majesty's leadership, an", "start": 876.72, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "entire country fully committed, land and", "start": 880.72, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "clean energy, full autonomy, trusted", "start": 884.48, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "laws and institutions,", "start": 888.24, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "access to vast and growing markets.", "start": 890.48, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "So GMC is a startup designed from the", "start": 894.399, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "beginning for success", "start": 897.76, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "and there is one guarantee I can give", "start": 901.12, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "you. Bhutan will not hedge its bets. We", "start": 903.68, "duration": 9.08}, {"text": "are all in.", "start": 909.04, "duration": 3.72}, {"text": "But every startup needs one more", "start": 912.88, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "critical ingredient", "start": 916.72, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "co-founders.", "start": 918.959, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "And that excellency is why this salesman", "start": 920.88, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "is standing before you.", "start": 924.72, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "We want your capital, your technology,", "start": 927.36, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "your talent, your ideas, your", "start": 930.48, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "enterprise.", "start": 933.279, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "And let me be absolutely clear.", "start": 935.04, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "We want you to make money.", "start": 938.56, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "GMC is not a retreat from capitalism,", "start": 941.92, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "technology, or ambition. It is designed", "start": 945.519, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "to harness all three without sacrificing", "start": 948.88, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "nature, culture, or human well-being.", "start": 952.0, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "Those who come early can help create the", "start": 955.6, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "industries and markets that others will", "start": 958.16, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "later enter. They can help define GMC's", "start": 960.959, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "economic journey and share in the value", "start": 964.56, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "they create.", "start": 967.6, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "That is a first mover advantage.", "start": 969.44, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "At GMC, commercial success and human", "start": 973.44, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "flourishing are designed to build on one", "start": 976.639, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "another.", "start": 979.44, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "This balance is deeply bin.", "start": 981.04, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "For more than half a century, Bhutan has", "start": 984.8, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "pursued gross national happiness.", "start": 987.44, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "It does not reject economic growth, but", "start": 990.8, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "it does ask the essential question, what", "start": 993.44, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "is growth for?", "start": 997.199, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "GMC gives this development philosophy", "start": 999.68, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "contemporary form through markets,", "start": 1002.48, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "technology and investment. But that", "start": 1005.04, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "aspiration itself is older. For", "start": 1008.16, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "centuries, the Himalayan Buddhist world", "start": 1011.279, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "has carried an ideal of an enlightened", "start": 1014.079, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "society,", "start": 1017.12, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "where material prosperity and spiritual", "start": 1018.88, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "wisdom coexist,", "start": 1021.519, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "where good governance serves human", "start": 1024.079, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "flourishing and where people live in", "start": 1026.559, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "harmony with one another and with", "start": 1028.799, "duration": 4.561}, {"text": "nature.", "start": 1031.6, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "That ideal is called Shambala.", "start": 1033.36, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "Some of our spiritual masters have", "start": 1037.679, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "looked at what is taking shape in GMC", "start": 1040.24, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "and have said", "start": 1043.039, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "under an enlightened king Shambala is", "start": 1045.12, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "being built.", "start": 1049.2, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "Now we make no claim to perfection", "start": 1051.2, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "for us. Shambala points not back to the", "start": 1054.72, "duration": 7.839}, {"text": "past but forward. a promise to carry its", "start": 1058.64, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "wisdom to the future", "start": 1062.559, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "to build a city that prospers", "start": 1065.76, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "and has a soul.", "start": 1068.64, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "Mr. President, I told you at the", "start": 1072.08, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "beginning that I come here as a", "start": 1074.72, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "salesman.", "start": 1076.799, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Now you know what I am selling.", "start": 1078.32, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "Kifu mindfulness city. So to governments", "start": 1081.919, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "and institutions seeking partnership and", "start": 1086.0, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "to investors, entrepreneurs and", "start": 1088.88, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "companies seeking the next great", "start": 1091.039, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "opportunity,", "start": 1092.96, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "do not watch GMC being built.", "start": 1094.559, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "Come to Bhutan.", "start": 1098.32, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "Come to GMC.", "start": 1100.4, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "Help define the journey. Build it with", "start": 1102.64, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "us. Become our co-founders.", "start": 1105.28, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "Because the future does not simply", "start": 1109.039, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "arrive. The future is built", "start": 1111.76, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "and in Bhutan we are already building", "start": 1115.52, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "it.", "start": 1118.08, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "Thank you for your kind attention and", "start": 1119.679, "duration": 5.401}, {"text": "tashid de", "start": 1121.76, "duration": 3.32}, {"text": "on behalf of the assembly I wish to", "start": 1130.32, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "thank the prime minister of the kingdom", "start": 1132.48, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "of Bhutan", "start": 1134.88, "duration": 2.56}]